<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(uu) &ldquo;<U>Mandatory
Prepayment</U>&rdquo; and &ldquo;<U>Mandatory Prepayment Price</U>&rdquo; have the meaning contained in Section 3.5(a)(i).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(vv) &ldquo;<U>Market Price</U>&rdquo;
means the average of the two lowest closing bid prices of the Common Stock on the Trading Market for the 10 consecutive Trading Days ending
on the Trading Day that is immediately prior to the applicable date of determination.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(ww) &ldquo;<U>Maturity Date</U>&rdquo;
has the meaning contained on page 1 of this Note.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(xx) &ldquo;<U>Note</U>&rdquo;
