<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(yy) &ldquo;<U>Notes</U>&rdquo;
means this Note and the Other Note(s).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(zz) &ldquo;<U>Notice in
Response to Inability to Convert</U>&rdquo; has the meaning contained in Section 3.5(b).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(aaa) &ldquo;<U>Notice of
Change of Control</U>&rdquo; has the meaning contained in Section 3.4(c).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(bbb) &ldquo;<U>Notice of
Prepayment at Option of Holder Upon Change of Control</U>&rdquo; has the meaning contained in Section 3.4(c).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(ccc) &ldquo;<U>Other Note(s)</U>&rdquo;
means any Note(s) issued to other Investor(s) under the Purchase Agreement or their permitted assigns.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 12.3pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 60.6pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(ddd) &ldquo;<U>Permitted
Indebtedness</U>&rdquo; means (a)&nbsp;the Indebtedness evidenced by this Note and the Other Note(s), (b)&nbsp;Indebtedness outstanding
on the date of this Note, (c)&nbsp;intercompany Indebtedness between the Company and one or more of its Subsidiaries or between one or
more of the Company&rsquo;s Subsidiaries, (d)&nbsp;unsecured Indebtedness incurred after the issue date of this Note, so long as the total
Indebtedness of the Company and its Subsidiaries, taken as a whole, does not exceed 5% of the market capitalization of the Ordinary Shares
on the date such Indebtedness is incurred.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(eee) &ldquo;<U>Permitted
Liens</U>&rdquo; means (i) Liens under the Transaction Documents, (ii) any lien for taxes not yet due or delinquent or being contested
in good faith by appropriate proceedings for which adequate reserves have been established in accordance with GAAP, (iii) any statutory
Lien arising in the ordinary course of business by operation of Law with respect to a liability that is not yet due or delinquent, (iv)
any Lien created by operation of Law, such as materialmen&rsquo;s Liens, mechanics&rsquo; Liens and other similar Liens, arising in the
ordinary course of business with respect to a liability that is not yet due or delinquent or that are being contested in good faith by
appropriate proceedings, (v)&nbsp;any Lien existing on the Original Issuance Date securing Indebtedness which is subordinated to the Note
in right of payment, and (vi) Liens arising from judgments, decrees or attachments in circumstances not constituting an Event of Default
under this Note.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(fff) &ldquo;<U>Pricing Period</U>&rdquo;
means the 10 Trading Days following the cure of an Event of Default as permitted by this Note.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"></P>

